---
import "../styles/global.css";

import H1 from "../components/H1.astro";
import H2 from "../components/H2.astro";
import P from "../components/P.astro";
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";

import Logo from "../assets/logo.svg";
---

<Layout title="Restored Beauty Coaching">
  <Logo slot="hero" class="max-w-150" />

  <H1 class="text-center">Restored Beauty Coaching</H1>

  <H2>Contact</H2>
  <P>
    I'm currently accepting virtual appointments for individual clients. Email
    me for a free consultation.
  </P>

  <P
    ><b>Email: </b>
    <a href="mailto:andrea@restoredbeautycoaching.com" class="text-blue-500"
      >andrea@restoredbeautycoaching.com</a
    ></P
  >

  <H2>What is Story Work?</H2>

  <P>
    We are shaped by the experiences, places, and people that surrounded us as
    we grew. Some memories shine bright and clear; others stay hidden, tucked
    away beneath the surface. When we craft these moments into concrete stories,
    we begin a journey of understanding ourselves more deeply. Story work helps
    us see how our past has shaped who we are today. Sharing our stories lets us
    see ourselves with fresh eyes. It helps us understand what has held us back
    from loving fully, reconnect with parts of ourselves we may have lost, and
    live with more purpose. Many of us carry pain from the past moments when we
    didn’t have the words or safe space to express what we felt. These hidden
    wounds often bring shame and keep us stuck. When we tell our stories in a
    caring, supportive space, healing can begin. We find the strength to face
    our pain, speak our truths, and let go of shame. Through this, we open the
    door to freedom and hope.
  </P>

